#. ちょっと苗木、脅かさないでよ！
#. 何か変な事言ったかと思っちゃったじゃん！
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"C'mon Makoto, don't scare me like that! Makes me think\n"
"something weird is going on!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと苗木、脅かさないでよ！
#. 何か変な事言ったかと思っちゃったじゃん！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"C'mon Makoto, don't scare me like that! Makes me think\n"
"something weird is going on!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>凶器となったジャスティスハンマーに
#. 振られていた番号…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The order that the Justice Hammers were used in to\n"
"commit the murders...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か…引っ掛かるんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something about that is bothering me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、ジャスティスハンマーには、
#. 番号が振られていたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The Justice Hammers *were* numbered, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当に、その番号通りに使われたのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...were they really used in that order?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
